Z||000003||JD86GT350||10-22-2001||07:37 PM||||here's one for you, the previous owner of my car had done this, and installed a switch in the dash.  He took the switch out because it just confused the other folks who drove the car and left it hotwired.  I have hooked up the switch again and....<P>Switch on = fan on and everything normal<BR>Switch off = fan off & speedometer off!<P>so I'm losin the ground to the speedo too?<BR>I just did this tonight, and ran out of time, so I thought I'd get some suggestions before I tackle it tomorrow||||reg||1
Z||000004||G-Nasty||10-23-2001||01:36 AM||||theres a relay switch (small plastic box) where you will need to pry the casing open and use a jumper wire. The fan will come on when ign is on. I did this a long time ago on another fiero. I may need to do it again on my current one-<BR>||||reg||1
